config XXCAR_BOARD_MATEKH743
	bool "Build for Mateksys H743-SLIM-V4"
	default n
	help
		Select the Mateksys H743-SLIM-V4 hardware description while reusing
		the common xxCar STM32H743 board layer.  Leave this disabled for the
		Holybro Pixhawk 6C/FMUV6C target.  Use tools/build.sh or make BOARD=...
		rather than changing this option by hand.
